    "overview": "Experience efficient performance and versatile compatibility with this compact yet powerful CPU cabinet. Designed to support Micro ATX and Mini ITX motherboards, it features four expansion slots and ample storage space, including two 13.36 cm (5.25) external bays, two 8.89 cm (3.5) internal slots, and three 6.35 cm (2.5) internal bays – ideal for both HDDs and SSDs (HDD x 2 & SSD x 2). Compatible with P4 motherboard series, the cabinet ensures smooth airflow with a pre-installed 80 mm cooling fan and a MIC port on the front panel for easy connectivity. Whether you're building a compact workstation or a home server, this cabinet offers reliable performance and functional design in a streamlined form factor.",
